OL,3,AFrom a village bakery to headlining
OL,4,AGlastonbury: How Harry Styles became a
OL,5,Astar
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Harry Styles was just 16, his
OL,8,Fmother Anne secretly signed up him up
OL,9,Ffor the ITV's The X Factor talent show
OL,10,Fin the hope of turning his singing
OL,11,Fdreams into a reality.
OL,13,FFast forward more than 15 years later
OL,14,Fand the 32-year-old is set for a
OL,15,Fprestigious headline slot at
OL,16,FGlastonbury 2027.
OL,18,FStyles will perform on the Pyramid
OL,19,FStage alongside Sam Fender and Billie
OL,20,FEilish with Cher among the other stars
OL,21,Fon the bill.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
